  "cl200Hl1": "Aurora Music is now Noxira Music, with a new look",
  "cl200Hl2": "Translate lyrics into any language, from more lyric sources",
  "cl200Hl3": "A redesigned home screen widget with playback controls",
  "cl200Hl4": "A redesigned queue",
  "cl200Hl5": "Choose where audio plays from the Bluetooth chip or Now Playing",
  "cl200Hl6": "Word-by-word lyrics when the source has the timing",
  "cl200Hl7": "Duplicate tracks are spotted, and you pick the copy to keep",
  "cl200Hl8": "Glass surfaces that adapt to your phone",
  "cl200Hl9": "Smoother transitions and faster detail pages",
  "cl200SecWelcome": "Welcome to Noxira",
  "cl200SecNew": "New Features",
  "cl200SecLibrary": "Playlists & Library",
  "cl200SecSetup": "Setup",
  "cl200SecLook": "Look & Feel",
  "cl200SecPerf": "Performance",
  "cl200SecHood": "Under the Hood",
  "cl200Welcome1": "Aurora Music is now Noxira Music, with a new name, wordmark and app icon",
  "cl200Welcome2": "A new animated splash screen draws the Noxira wordmark",
  "cl200Welcome3": "Existing users get a short welcome page explaining what is new, and you can open it again from Settings",
  "cl200New1": "Translate lyrics into any language you like, not only the app languages",
  "cl200New2": "Redesigned home screen widget: glass tinted with your artwork, previous / play / next buttons that work without opening the app, and recommended songs when the widget is tall",
  "cl200New3": "Redesigned queue page — see what played and what is next, drag to reorder, swipe to remove; an Up next preview now sits on Now Playing",
  "cl200New4": "A monthly support goal appears on the home app bar from time to time, and in Settings under About",
  "cl200New5": "Pull down in the Library to refresh it",
  "cl200New6": "Choose where audio plays: tap the Bluetooth chip on the home screen, or the new output island on Now Playing, to move playback between your phone speaker and connected devices without leaving the app",
  "cl200New7": "Speed and pitch now have their own sliders, and you can link pitch to speed",
  "cl200New8": "Five new visualizer styles, and a finer spectrum with more bars",
  "cl200New9": "Optional announcements from the Noxira team can appear on the home screen, with a button that opens a link or a screen of the app",
  "cl200Lyrics1": "Redesigned lyrics page: tap a line to jump to it, dots mark instrumental breaks, and the lyrics box on Now Playing follows along",
  "cl200Lyrics2": "More lyric sources (BetterLyrics, YouLyPlus and KuGou) are tried when LRCLIB has nothing; choose which ones to use in Settings",
  "cl200Lyrics3": "Lyrics stored in the audio file, or in a .lrc file next to the song, are used first and work offline",
  "cl200Lyrics4": "Auto-hide controls on the full-screen lyrics is now an option and off by default",
  "cl200Lyrics5": "Fixed lyrics that flickered and then disappeared with “no lyrics available”, including after a refresh or a manual search",
  "cl200Lyrics6": "Word-by-word lyrics: when a source has per-word timing, each word lights up as it is sung",
  "cl200Library1": "New add-to-playlist sheet: add, remove and create playlists in one place, with songs already in a playlist marked",
  "cl200Library2": "A song can no longer be added to the same playlist twice, and a Remove duplicates option cleans up existing ones",
  "cl200Library3": "Noxira now notices duplicate tracks in your library and, in the Library tab, offers to review them: you pick which copy to keep",
  "cl200Library4": "Redesigned Playlists page: Favorites on top, automatic playlists as tiles and your own playlists as a grid with artwork mosaics",
  "cl200Library5": "Redesigned Search tab: a glass search bar, result counts and clearer empty and no-result states",
  "cl200Library6": "The playing-song icon now follows the track in playlists",
  "cl200Library7": "Optional online suggestions: artist info and similar artists from Deezer and Wikipedia (only the artist name is sent)",
  "cl200Library8": "The equalizer no longer reports itself as unavailable by mistake; it retries on its own and offers Retry and Open system equalizer",
  "cl200Library9": "Cache Information now shows real sizes, its button closes the dialog, and Clear Cache also clears downloaded artist images",
  "cl200Setup1": "Redesigned onboarding with glass panels, entrance animations and a flowing background",
  "cl200Setup2": "Setup recommends the interface style that suits your phone (high-end or lightweight) and the matching background, and lets you try the other one",
  "cl200Setup3": "The lightweight interface now always uses a plain background; the Animated Blobs option was removed",
  "cl200Setup4": "Settings is now sorted into groups (Experience, Library & data, App) with the same simple glass look as setup",
  "cl200Setup5": "Messages appear as a small island at the bottom of the screen instead of snack bars",
  "cl200Look1": "New app font (Cal Sans) and slightly more compact text across the app",
  "cl200Look2": "Frosted glass surfaces throughout, drawn as plain solid surfaces on low-end phones",
  "cl200Look3": "Artwork flies from cards into album, artist, folder and playlist pages; pressed cards respond, liked songs burst into hearts, and the time labels roll",
  "cl200Look4": "Rounded-square play button on Favorite Songs",
  "cl200Look5": "Home and Library cards use the same glass look as setup, without an extra blur on top of the blurred background",
  "cl200Perf1": "Noxira detects your phone's hardware and tunes glass effects, image caches and transitions to it",
  "cl200Perf2": "Album, artist, folder and playlist pages open smoothly: they load after the opening animation, build a short first page of songs and blur their header artwork ahead of time",
  "cl200Perf3": "Library queries that overlap are shared instead of repeated, which lowers memory use on big libraries",
  "cl200Perf4": "Faster search and library rescans, lighter image loading and less work while lists scroll",
  "cl200Hood1": "Fixed several crashes: tapping Close in the lyrics editor, the tag editor or the sleep timer after the page was gone, adding to the queue or setting a ringtone from a song menu, translating lyrics, and opening Noxira from the widget",
  "cl200Hood2": "The app no longer crashes when storage permission is missing",
  "cl200Hood3": "Playlists, liked songs, play counts and settings are saved safely, so an interrupted save can no longer leave an empty file",
  "cl200Hood4": "FLAC files whose metadata blocks were left incomplete by a tag editor are repaired when saved, so they play again",
  "cl200Hood5": "Media notification artwork is downscaled to avoid freezes while the notification is built",
  "cl200Hood6": "Editing tags on voice recordings (M4A) no longer fails because of leftover data at the end of the file",
  "cl200Hood7": "The visualizer no longer distorts Dolby Atmos tracks; they use the simulated animation instead",
  "cl200Hood8": "Phones that cannot create an equalizer effect now play normally, and the equalizer waits for the first song instead of timing out",
  "cl200Hood9": "Check for updates now shows its result, and says so when updates come from Google Play",
  "cl200Hood10": "Announcements, the support goal and some online services can be adjusted without an app update",
